# Repo orientation

Personal experimental server for https://vlandivir.com. Mixed stacks are expected. Do not unify Nest, vanilla `web/`, React `telegram-app/`, SwiftUI `mobile/`, or Tauri `desktop/` unless asked.

**Map:** [docs/repo-map.md](docs/repo-map.md). Architecture: [docs/project-overview.md](docs/project-overview.md). Access: [docs/authorization.md](docs/authorization.md). Web CSS: [web-design-system.mdc](web-design-system.mdc).

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `src/` | NestJS: APIs, Telegram webhook, Prisma, scripts |
| `web/<page>/` | Static pages; shared theme in `web/shared/` |
| `telegram-app/` | Vite GTD + Mini App → served at `/gtd` and `/mini-app` |
| `desktop/trip-montage/` | Tauri trip export |
| `mobile/gtd-ios/`, `mobile/gps-tracker-ios/` | Xcode apps |
| `prisma/` | Shared prod Postgres via SSH tunnel (`ssh -N vlandivir-db`) — never migrate reset |

No nested git repos. Feature branches only, not `main`. New env vars: `.env` + Dockerfile + deploy workflow + GitHub secret.
